Herald OS desktop control: third_party/agent-desktop

This directory holds a modified copy of agent-desktop by Vercel Labs
(https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-desktop), revision
9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The license text is in LICENSE next to this file, unchanged.

The code has been modified: only the Linux parts are carried, and the
workspace manifest, the command-line crate's manifest and Cargo.lock are
trimmed to them. PATCHES.md lists every changed file and why; patches/ holds
the changes as diffs against the pinned revision.

vendor/ holds the Rust crates the build depends on, as `cargo vendor` writes
them from Cargo.lock. Each crate keeps its own license files.
